"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hirosaka Kouta's younger sister. Calls her brother \"Nii-san\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"An athletic girl, and is a member of school track and field club. Occasionally, she would quarrel with Kouta as a joke, but really never have an actual fight with him. She is really proud of her reliable brother, and love him very much as a family member."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When Kouta's arms transformed into tentacles and raped her, she doesn't blame him for it. On the contrary, she lends him a hand and offered to do anything to help him control the tentacles."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c99133"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の妹、陸上部所属でスポーツ万能。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"兄のことは兄妹として好きで、優等生な兄のことは頼りがいのある存在だと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"世話を焼かれすぎなことに対して反抗することも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"触手が生えた兄とのHで処女を喪失し、それから徐々に触手の快楽にハマっていく。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22572","sourceWorkId":"29503","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の妹、陸上部所属でスポーツ万能。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"兄のことは兄妹として好きで、優等生な兄のことは頼りがいのある存在だと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"世話を焼かれすぎなことに対して反抗することも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"触手が生えた兄とのHで処女を喪失し、それから徐々に触手の快楽にハマっていく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「はぁ……これだから、このアホ兄さんは……」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92477"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3e/3e1d4b47cb6d155797ff46bb528b1e1cf00a1632a0b3f9bf9a8b7d4a88f65580.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/41/41e87fb5451a9309cff1fea0bf534eb2852cccc7ba1e91cddd76c4c00c0f769e.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"瑞森柚子","creatorId":"egs:creator:36244","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:36244","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:36244","name":"瑞森柚子","roleCode":"voic